  "body_html": "<p>Celebrate your passion for the game with the personalized basketball blanket by Jeminise. Perfect for basketball players, coaches, and fans, this custom blanket brings warmth and sports styling to your bedroom, living room couch, or outdoor adventures. Featuring a close-up design of a basketball hoop and net, it makes a thoughtful, customized gift for birthdays, holidays, or special occasions.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your choice of Name and Number for a truly unique sports gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Fabric:</strong> Available in both super soft Fleece and plush Sherpa fabric options, crafted with two polyester layers for consecutive warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant &amp; Long-Lasting:</strong> Printed with long-lasting color ink on smooth material to keep the basketball design eye-catching and colorful.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple Sizes Available:</strong> Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) to suit kids, teens, or adults.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Comfort:</strong> Lightweight and functional for napping, reading, travel, camping, picnics, or relaxing on the sofa.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on air dry without heat to remain fluffy.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Basketball, Game</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Travel Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Custom Name &amp; Number (2 text inputs)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40\"x30\"), Medium (50\"x40\"), Large (60\"x50\"), X-Large (80\"x60\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
